{
  "name": "Giant's Havoc",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your rages pull strength from the primal might of giants, transforming you into a hulking force of destruction. While raging, you gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><strong>Crushing Hurl.</strong> When you make a ranged weapon attack with a thrown weapon or an improvised weapon, you double your rage damage bonus to the attack's damage.</li><li><strong>Giant Stature.</strong> Your reach increases by 5 feet, and if you are smaller than Large, you become Large, along with anything you are wearing. If there isn't enough room for you to become Large, your size doesn't change.</li></ul>",
